rkansas/mississippi-county"],["ARC or PLC in Mississippi County","/arc-plc/arkansas/mississippi-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids shows October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, July to August ran 47% of normal and November to December 34%. So far in 2026, January to February sat at 45% and February to March at 43%. Every grid&rsquo;s driest year was 1963, with grid 18759 at 52%.</p>"}
